# The upstream ELF interpreter is retained unchanged; it is not an unused
# application library that this recipe can remove.
voice-strip W: Unused shared library '/usr/lib64/ld-linux-x86-64.so.2' by file ('usr/bin/voice-strip')
# A running PipeWire server is required to publish the virtual microphone;
# ELF dependency analysis detects only the separately declared client library.
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('pipewire')
# Winit's X11 backend loads libX11, libXcursor and libXi at runtime.
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('libx11')
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('libxcursor')
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('libxi')
# Winit loads keyboard handling libraries for its Wayland and X11 backends.
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('libxkbcommon')
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('libxkbcommon-x11')
# Wgpu loads libvulkan.so.1 dynamically for GPU rendering.
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('vulkan-icd-loader')
# Winit loads the Wayland client libraries dynamically.
voice-strip W: Dependency included, but may not be needed ('wayland')
